# Placeholder vendor sepolicy for M6T.
#
# The build is androidboot.selinux=permissive and SELINUX_IGNORE_NEVERALLOWS is
# on. Two pieces of evidence, neither of them speculation:
#   FACT: the FACTORY boot image of this device already boots permissive - its
#     cmdline is `bootopt=64S3,32N2,64N2 androidboot.selinux=permissive`
#     (header parse of /srv/forge/m6t-dump/boot.img).
#   FACT: the sibling M6 lane had to disable build-time neverallow assertions for
#     this exact blob family one Android release earlier ("Pie public-policy
#     neverallows reject Oreo-era MTK vendor rules"), and A13's policy is
#     stricter than Pie's.
#
# Nothing real can be written here until an M6T exists and boots far enough to
# produce a single avc denial.
